            "mapper": {
                "input": "You are an autonomous B2B Sales Qualifying AI Agent. Your goal is to analyze incoming lead data and decide which operational action (tool) to take.\n\nAVAILABLE TOOLS TO CHOOSE FROM:\n1. \"alert_high_value_sales_team\" -> Choose this tool ONLY if the prospect has a high monthly budget (>= \\$2,000) AND critical/immediate urgency (words like ASAP, right away, losing money).\n2. \"send_to_nurturing_email_list\" -> Choose this tool if the prospect has a low budget (< \\$2,000) OR shows no immediate urgency.\n\n[INBOUND LEAD DATA]\nCustomer Name: {{1.lead_name}}\nBudget: {{1.monthly_budget}}\nChallenge:{{1.main_challenge}}\n[OUTPUT MANDATE]\nAnalyze the data and choose the best tool. You must output ONLY a raw JSON format. Do not include markdown code blocks, backticks (```), or introductory words. \n\nStrict Output Structure:\n{\n  \"selected_tool\": \"write_the_chosen_tool_name_here\",\n  \"reason\": \"Write a 1-sentence reason why you chose this tool\"\n}\n"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 300,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "setupValidation": {
                    "result": {
                        "valid": true,
                        "fields": []
                    },
                    "version": 1,
                    "configuration": "211c58df569e5200"
                },
                "restore": {
                    "parameters": {
                        "model": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "SmallModel: gpt-5-nano. Reasoning: minimal. Efficiently handles long conversations and reasoning, delivering smart conclusions quickly",
